iance-examination-manual/ii-3-...</a><span class="ml-2 inline-block rounded-xl px-2 py-0.5 text-eyebrow-sm uppercase tracking-wide bg-teal-50 text-teal-700">trusted</span></li></ol></section><p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Educational content only. Not legal, tax, or financial advice.</p><div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-6">Related Posts</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><article class="relative group bg-white rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col h-full"><div class="h-40 w-full overflow-hidden relative "><img alt="The Freelance Payment Penalty: A Modeled Audit of Platform Fees, FX Spreads, and Payout Delays" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 25vw, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Ffeature-global-payouts-currency-exchange-money.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="p-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 bg-teal-50 px-2 py-1 rounded">Research Reports</span><span class="text-sm text-slate-500">19<!-- --> min read</span></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors line-clamp-2"><a class="after:absolute after:inset-0" href="/blog/freelance-payment-fees-audit">The Freelance Payment Penalty: A Modeled Audit of Platform Fees, FX Spreads, and Payout Delays</a></h3><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-6 flex-grow line-clamp-3 leading-relaxed">The money rarely disappears through a single, easy-to-spot fee. The real loss is stacked. A marketplace takes its commission, a processor adds a charge for international cards, a bank or payment company converts the currency at a spread, a platform holds the funds before release, and a wire sheds a little to intermediaries on the way in. Each layer looks defensible on its own, but the worker feels the combined result as a smaller deposit and a later payday.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-slate-50 mt-auto"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1"><span class="text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors">freelance payment fees</span><span class="text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors">cross-border payments</span><span class="text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors">platform fees</span></div><span class="text-brand-primary text-sm font-bold transition-colors flex items-center">Read<svg class="ml-1 h-3.5 w-3.5 transform transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg></span></div></div></article><article class="relative group bg-white rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col h-full"><div class="h-40 w-full overflow-hidden relative "><img alt="How to Respond to a Subpoena for Business Records" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 25vw, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.pexels.com%2Fphotos%2F6170642%2Fpexels-photo-6170642.jpeg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%26cs%3Dtinysrgb%26w%3D600%26q%3D80&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="p-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-teal-600 bg-teal-50 px-2 py-1 rounded">Legal Action</span><span class="text-sm text-slate-500">26<!-- --> min read</span></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors line-clamp-2"><a class="after:absolute after:inset-0" href="/blog/how-to-respond-to-a-subpoena-for-business-records">How to Respond to a Subpoena for Business Records</a></h3><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-6 flex-grow line-clamp-3 leading-relaxed">Move fast, but do not produce records on instinct. If you need to **respond to a subpoena for business records**, your immediate job is to control deadlines, preserve records, and make any later production defensible.</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-slate-50 mt-auto"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1"><span class="text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors">subpoena response</span><span class="text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors">legal document</span><span class="text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors">e-discovery</span></div><span class="text-brand-primary text-sm font-bold transition-colors flex items-center">Read<svg class="ml-1 h-3.5 w-3.5 transform transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg></span></div></div></article><article class="relative group bg-white rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col h-full"><div class="h-40 w-full overflow-hidden relative bg-background-default"><img alt="A US Expat&#x27;s Guide to Investing in UCITS ETFs to Avoid PFIC Issues" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 25vw, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcSet="/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,width=256,quality=75,fit=scale-down,metadata=none/https://gruvprodpublicmediasg.blob.core.windows.net/media/v1/generated/blog-diagrams/1023-us-expat-guide-to-investing-in-ucits-etfs-to-avoid-pfic-tier-2-the-core-portfolio-decision-matrix-calculated-complexity-for--2c05cb187699.png 256w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,width=384,quality=75,fit=scale-down,metadata=none/https://gruvprodpublicmediasg.blob.core.windows.net/media/v1/generated/blog-diagrams/1023-us-expat-guide-to-investing-in-ucits-etfs-to-avoid-pfic-tier-2-the-core-portfolio-decision-matrix-calculated-complexity-for--2c05cb187699.png 384w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,width=640,quality=75,fit=scale-down,metadata=none/https://gruvprodpublicmediasg.blob.core.windows.net/media/v1/generated/blog-diagrams/1023-us-expat-guide-to-investing-in-ucits-etfs-to-avoid-pfic-tier-2-the-core-portfolio-decision-matrix-calculated-complexity-for--2c05cb187699.png 64