te deal-critical from nice-to-have\",\"id\":\"step-3-separate-deal-critical-from-nice-to-have\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Assemble prerequisites before you score markets\",\"id\":\"assemble-prerequisites-before-you-score-markets\",\"level\":2},{\"text\":\"Step 1: Assign a designated owner for readiness\",\"id\":\"step-1-assign-a-designated-owner-for-readiness\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 2: Anchor your review to the formal request terms\",\"id\":\"step-2-anchor-your-review-to-the-formal-request-terms\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 3: Make financial-responsibility evidence explicit\",\"id\":\"step-3-make-financial-responsibility-evidence-explicit\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 4: Score only what is documented and current\",\"id\":\"step-4-score-only-what-is-documented-and-current\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Build a market-by-market readiness scorecard\",\"id\":\"build-a-market-by-market-readiness-scorecard\",\"level\":2},{\"text\":\"Step 1: Keep each market/vertical in one row\",\"id\":\"step-1-keep-each-marketvertical-in-one-row\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 2: Treat hard gates as explicit fields\",\"id\":\"step-2-treat-hard-gates-as-explicit-fields\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 3: Capture operational fit in the same row\",\"id\":\"step-3-capture-operational-fit-in-the-same-row\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 4: Record confidence the way diligence will test it\",\"id\":\"step-4-record-confidence-the-way-diligence-will-test-it\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 1 audit compliance evidence and policy gates\",\"id\":\"step-1-audit-compliance-evidence-and-policy-gates\",\"level\":2},{\"text\":\"Step 1.1 Test the CMS in operation\",\"id\":\"step-11-test-the-cms-in-operation\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 1.2 Validate third-party controls with named evidence\",\"id\":\"step-12-validate-third-party-controls-with-named-evidence\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 1.3 Verify policy gates by product and jurisdiction\",\"id\":\"step-13-verify-policy-gates-by-product-and-jurisdiction\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 2 validate technical controls buyers test first\",\"id\":\"step-2-validate-technical-controls-buyers-test-first\",\"level\":2},{\"text\":\"Step 2.1 Start with a technology stack assessment\",\"id\":\"step-21-start-with-a-technology-stack-assessment\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 2.2 Check for technical due-diligence alarm bells\",\"id\":\"step-22-check-for-technical-due-diligence-alarm-bells\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 2.3 Capture findings in a repeatable checklist\",\"id\":\"step-23-capture-findings-in-a-repeatable-checklist\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 3 prove financial readiness without cleanup fire drills\",\"id\":\"step-3-prove-financial-readiness-without-cleanup-fire-drills\",\"level\":2},{\"text\":\"Step 3.1 Align reporting definitions before you polish the deck\",\"id\":\"step-31-align-reporting-definitions-before-you-polish-the-deck\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 3.2 Prepare Audited Financial Statements and market-level views from the same base\",\"id\":\"step-32-prepare-audited-financial-statements-and-market-level-views-from-the-same-base\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 3.3 Tie finance outputs to compliance and operations evidence\",\"id\":\"step-33-tie-finance-outputs-to-compliance-and-operations-evidence\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 3.4 Flag accounting-policy assumptions while there is still time to explain them\",\"id\":\"step-34-flag-accounting-policy-assumptions-while-there-is-still-time-to-explain-them\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Set go conditional-go no-go decisions by market\",\"id\":\"set-go-conditional-go-no-go-decisions-by-market\",\"level\":2},{\"text\":\"Step 1 Apply one standard across markets\",\"id\":\"step-1-apply-one-standard-across-markets\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 2 Use conditional-go only for bounded remediation\",\"id\":\"step-2-use-conditional-go-only-for-bounded-remediation\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 3 Call no-go early when the dependency is structural\",\"id\":\"step-3-call-no-go-early-when-the-dependency-is-structural\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 4 Compare United States and Europe side by side\",\"id\":\"step-4-compare-united-states-and-europe-side-by-side\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Sequence execution from pre-LOI through Day 1\",\"id\":\"sequence-execution-from-pre-loi-through-day-1\",\"level\":2},{\"text\":\"Step 1 Freeze supported scope before the LOI\",\"id\":\"step-1-freeze-supported-scope-before-the-loi\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 2 Publish versioned evidence during confirmatory diligence\",\"id\":\"step-2-publish-versioned-evidence-during-confirmatory-diligence\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 3 Use the pre-close window as a readiness checkpoint\",\"id\":\"step-3-use-the-pre-close-window-as-a-readiness-checkpoint\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 4 Run Day 1 against documented evidence, not new promises\",\"id\":\"step-4-run-day-1-against-documented-evidence-not-new-promises\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 5 Keep post-Day 1 remediation separate from launch-critical controls\",\"id\":\"step-5-keep-post-day-1-remediation-separate-from-launch-critical-controls\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Common mistakes that kill deals and how to recover\",\"id\":\"common-mistakes-that-kill-deals-and-how-to-recover\",\"level\":2},{\"text\":\"1) Overstating readiness when controls are still partly manual\",\"id\":\"1-overstating-readiness-when-controls-are-still-partly-manual\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"2) Treating GAAP normalization as a late-stage cleanup task\",\"id\":\"2-treating-gaap-normalization-as-a-late-stage-cleanup-task\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"3) Polishing the growth narrative before the evidence pack\",\"id\":\"3-polishing-the-growth-narrative-before-the-evidence-pack\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"4) Launching new scope with unresolved dependency ownership\",\"id\":\"4-launching-new-scope-with-unresolved-dependency-ownership\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Apply Gruv modules to close the highest-risk gaps first\",\"id\":\"apply-gruv-modules-to-close-the-highest-risk-gaps-first\",\"level\":2},{\"text\":\"Conclusion and copy-paste readiness checklist\",\"id\":\"conclusion-and-copy-paste-readiness-checklist\",\"level\":2},{\"text\":\"Step 1 Confirm one scorecard exists for every core claim\",\"id\":\"step-1-confirm-one-scorecard-exists-for-every-core-claim\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 2 Confirm CMS evidence is current and mapped to PPS/IPPS mechanics\",\"id\":\"step-2-confirm-cms-evidence-is-current-and-mapped-to-ppsipps-mechanics\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 3 Confirm rate-update statements keep their qualifying conditions\",\"id\":\"step-3-confirm-rate-update-statements-keep-their-qualifying-conditions\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 4 Confirm episode and timing details are stated exactly\",\"id\":\"step-4-confirm-episode-and-timing-details-are-stated-exactly\",\"level\":3},{\"text\":\"Step 5 Confirm unverified areas are explicitly marked as unverified\",\"id\":\"step-5-confirm-unverified-areas-are-explicitly-marked-as-unverified\",\"level\":3}]}],\"$L2f\",\"$L30\"]}]}],\"$L31\"]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"32:I[747131,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0ofwgd9nlqhxo.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1njky_r_w4qgn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/30oxmldyxquxn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01-nqr1jw9mmk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2aasks71biu4z.js\"],\"default\"]\n33:I[200419,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0ofwgd9nlqhxo.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1njky_r_w4qgn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/30oxmldyxquxn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01-nqr1jw9mmk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2aasks71biu4z.js\"],\"default\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3\",\"children\":\"Tags\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L18\",\"0\",{\"href\":\"/blog/tags/compliance-technical\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"inline-block px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 hover:text-slate-900 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"compliance technical\"}],[\"$\",\"$L18\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/blog/tags/financial-readiness\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"inline-block px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 hover:text-slate-900 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"financial readiness\"}],[\"$\",\"$L18\",\"2\",{\"href\":\"/blog/tags/payment-platform-acquisition\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"inline-block px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 hover:text-slate-900 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"payment platform acquisition\"}],[\"$\",\"$L18\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"/blog/tags/acquisition-compliance\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"inline-block px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 hover:text-slate-900 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"acquisition compliance\"}],[\"$\",\"$L18\",\"4\",{\"href\":\"/blog/tags/prepare-payment\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"inline-block px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 hover:text-slate-900 hover:underline\",\"children\":\"prepare payment\"}]]}],null]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"30:[\"$\",\"$L32\",null,{\"slug\":\"prepare-payment-platform-acquisition-compliance-technical-financial-readiness\",\"title\":\"Prepare Your Payment Platform for Acquisition: Compliance, Technical, and Financial Readiness\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://gruv.ai/blog/prepare-payment-platform-acquisition-compliance-technical-financial-readiness\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"31:[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"order-1 flex-1 min-w-0 overflow-x-hidden lg:order-1\",\"data-content-type\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"quick-answer\",\"aria-label\":\"Quick answer\",\"data-qa\":\"quick-answer\",\"data-helper-surface\":\"quick-answer\",\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border-l-[3px] border border-l-[#0d9488] border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/40 p-6 shadow-sm mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"quick-answer-heading\",\"className\":\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500\",\"children\":\"Quick Answer\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-800 font-medium\",\"children\":\"Prepare your payment platform for an acquisition by proving, with current records, that compliance controls work in production, transactions are traceable end to end, and financial reporting ties back to support files. Use one market-by-market scorecard with go, conditional-go, or no-go labels, named owners, verification dates, caveats, and clear evidence for every claim.\"}]]}],null,null,[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L33\",null,{\"keyTakeaways\":[],\"aiText\":\"A payment platform is acquisition-ready when it can prove Day 1 legal and operational readiness with documented evidence, not verbal explanations. The article recommends scoring each market separately against three pillars: Compliance Management System maturity, technical traceability, and GAAP-ready finance. Every claim should tie to a current artifact, a named owner, and a verification date. Mark a market go only when compliance checks, technical controls, and financial support are all verifiable in documents and operating proof. Use conditional-go only for one bounded gap with a named owner and a dated checkpoint, and use no-go when the blocker is structural or depends on one person. Technical diligence should focus on production evidence, including transaction traceability, exception handling, and controls that hold under concurrency and retries. Financial readiness should show stable reporting definitions, explicit change records, and support files that reconcile reported performance.\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-headings:text-slate-900 prose-p:text-slate-900 prose-strong:text-slate-900 max-w-none\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"id\":\"what-buyers-will-review-before-acquiring-your-payment-platform\",\"className\":\"group mt-14 mb-6 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 blog-accent-border font-sans\",\"style\":{\"scrollMarginTop\":\"calc(var(--header-height, 80px) + 2rem)\"},\"children\":[\"What Buyers Will Review Before Acquiring Your Payment Platform\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#what-buyers-will-review-before-acquiring-your-payment-platform\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to What Buyers Will Review Before Acquiring Your Payment Platform\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Acquisition prep for a payment platform is a cross-functional evidence test, not a finance-only exercise. Frame readiness around whether you can show compliance controls in production, trace money movement, and validate reporting without last-minute rework.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"Use one market-by-market scorecard to make explicit internal calls: \",\"$L34\",\", \",\"$L35\",\", or \",\"$L36\",\". These are operating labels, not regulator-defined categories. Use them to make expansion and M\u0026A decisions from documented evidence rather than assumptions.\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L37\",\"\\n\",\"$L38\",\"\\n\",\"$L39\",\"\\n\",\"$L3a\",\"\\n\",\"$L3b\",\"\\n\",\"$L3c\",\"\\n\",\"$L3d\",\"\\n\",\"$L3e\",\"\\n\",\"$L3f\",\"\\n\",\"$L40\",\"\\n\",\"$L41\",\"\\n\",\"$L42\",\"\\n\",\"$L43\",\"\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"$L44\",\"\\n\",\"$L45\",\"\\n\",\"$L46\",\"\\n\",\"$L47\",\"\\n\",\"$L48\",\"\\n\",\"$L49\",\"\\n\",\"$L4a\",\"\\n\",\"$L4b\",\"\\n\",\"$L4c\",\"\\n\",\"$L4d\",\"\\n\",\"$L4e\",\"\\n\",\"$L4f\",\"\\n\",\"$L50\",\"\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"$L51\",\"\\n\",\"$L52\",\"\\n\",\"$L53\",\"\\n\",\"$L54\",\"\\n\",\"$L55\",\"\\n\",\"$L56\",\"\\n\",\"$L57\",\"\\n\",\"$L58\",\"\\n\",\"$L59\",\"\\n\",\"$L5a\",\"\\n\",\"$L5b\",\"\\n\",\"$L5c\",\"\\n\",\"$L5d\",\"\\n\",\"$L5e\",\"\\n\",\"$L5f\",\"\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"$L60\",\"\\n\",\"$L61\",\"\\n\",\"$L62\",\"\\n\",\"$L63\",\"\\n\",\"$L64\",\"\\n\",\"$L65\",\"\\n\",\"$L66\",\"\\n\",\"$L67\",\"\\n\",\"$L68\",\"\\n\",\"$L69\",\"\\n\",\"$L6a\",\"\\n\",\"$L6b\",\"\\n\",\"$L6c\",\"\\n\",\"$L6d\",\"\\n\",\"$L6e\",\"\\n\",\"$L6f\",\"\\n\",\"$L70\",\"\\n\",\"$L71\",\"\\n\",\"$L72\",\"\\n\",\"$L73\",\"\\n\",\"$L74\",\"\\n\",\"$L75\",\"\\n\",\"$L76\",\"\\n\",\"$L77\",\"\\n\",\"$L78\",\"\\n\",\"$L79\",\"\\n\",\"$L7a\",\"\\n\",\"$L7b\",\"\\n\",\"$L7c\",\"\\n\",\"$L7d\",\"\\n\",\"$L7e\",\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\",\"\\n\",\"$L8a\",\"\\n\",\"$L8b\",\"\\n\",\"$L8c\",\"\\n\",\"$L8d\",\"\\n\",\"$L8e\",\"\\n\",\"$L8f\",\"\\n\",\"$L90\",\"\\n\",\"$L91\",\"\\n\",\"$L92\",\"\\n\",\"$L93\",\"\\n\",\"$L94\",\"\\n\",\"$L95\",\"\\n\",\"$L96\",\"\\n\",\"$L97\",\"\\n\",\"$L98\",\"\\n\",\"$L99\",\"\\n\",\"$L9a\",\"\\n\",\"$L9b\",\"\\n\",\"$L9c\",\"\\n\",\"$L9d\",\"\\n\",\"$L9e\",\"\\n\",\"$L9f\",\"\\n\",\"$La0\",\"\\n\",\"$La1\",\"\\n\",\"$La2\",\"\\n\",\"$La3\",\"\\n\",\"$La4\",\"\\n\",\"$La5\",\"\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"$La6\",\"\\n\",\"$La7\",\"\\n\",\"$La8\",\"\\n\",\"$La9\",\"\\n\",\"$Laa\",\"\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\",\"$Lab\",\"\\n\",\"$Lac\",\"\\n\",\"$Lad\",\"\\n\",\"$Lae\",\"\\n\",\"$Laf\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb0\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb1\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb2\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb3\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb4\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb5\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb6\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb7\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb8\",\"\\n\",\"$Lb9\",\"\\n\",\"$Lba\",\"\\n\",\"$Lbb\",\"\\n\",\"$Lbc\",\"\\n\",\"$Lbd\",\"\\n\",\"$Lbe\",\"\\n\",\"$Lbf\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc0\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc1\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc2\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc3\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc4\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc5\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc6\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc7\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc8\",\"\\n\",\"$Lc9\",\"\\n\",\"$Lca\",\"\\n\",\"$Lcb\",\"\\n\",\"$Lcc\",\"\\n\",\"$Lcd\",\"\\n\",\"$Lce\",\"\\n\",\"$Lcf\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld0\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld1\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld2\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld3\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld4\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld5\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld6\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld7\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld8\",\"\\n\",\"$Ld9\",\"\\n\",\"$Lda\",\"\\n\",\"$Ldb\",\"\\n\",\"$Ldc\",\"\\n\",\"$Ldd\",\"\\n\",\"$Lde\",\"\\n\",\"$Ldf\",\"\\n\",\"$Le0\"]}],\"$Le1\",\"$undefined\",false,\"$Le2\",\"$Le3\",null,\"$Le4\",\"$Le5\",\"$Le6\"]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"e7:I[197599,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0ofwgd9nlqhxo.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1njky_r_w4qgn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/30oxmldyxquxn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01-nqr1jw9mmk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2aasks71biu4z.js\"],\"default\"]\n34:[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded text-sm\",\"node\":{\"type\":\"element\",\"tagName\":\"code\",\"properties\":{},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"go\",\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":69,\"offset\":394},\"end\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":73,\"offset\":398}}}],\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":69,\"offset\":394},\"end\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":73,\"offset\":398}}},\"children\":\"go\"}]\n35:[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-1\",{\"className\":\"bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded text-sm\",\"node\":{\"type\":\"element\",\"tagName\":\"code\",\"properties\":{},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"conditional-go\",\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":75,\"offset\":400},\"end\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":91,\"offset\":416}}}],\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":75,\"offset\":400},\"end\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":91,\"offset\":416}}},\"children\":\"conditional-go\"}]\n36:[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-2\",{\"className\":\"bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded text-sm\",\"node\":{\"type\":\"element\",\"tagName\":\"code\",\"properties\":{},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"no-go\",\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":96,\"offset\":421},\"end\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":103,\"offset\":428}}}],\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":96,\"offset\":421},\"end\":{\"line\":5,\"column\":103,\"offset\":428}}},\"children\":\"no-go\"}]\n37:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Keep the scorecard document-first. Formal acquisition planning frameworks emphasize written plan content, and the practical takeaway applies here: documented claims are stronger claims. That does not mean FAR Part 7 governs private payments M\u0026A. It means undocumented claims are weak claims.\"}]\n38:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"Use the same standard for compliance checks. A concrete verification pattern from the \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"https://www.federalreserve.gov/supervisionreg/guide-regulation-cc-compliance.htm\",\"children\":\"Federal Reserve's Regulation CC examination guide\",\"rel\":\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"text-brand-teal underline decoration-[#0d9488]/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#0d9488] transition-colors\"}],\" is to compare actual deposit transactions with disclosure statements and verify disclosures and notices tied to funds-availability rules. Keep the guide's own limitation in view too: it is an overview, not a complete legal statement.\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Technical readiness also needs proof. In automated payments contexts, idempotency is an essential control, and known failure modes include isolation breaking under concurrency and retry-driven inconsistency. A scorecard entry like \\\"reconciliation works\\\" is not enough unless you can show operational evidence that controls hold under concurrency and retries.\"}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Financial readiness is the third pillar. Treat it as a qualifier for scrutiny, not just a growth story, and be ready to show financial preparedness with records that support reported performance.\"}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-0\",{\"id\":\"before-you-start\",\"className\":\"group mt-8 mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Before you start\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#before-you-start\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Before you start\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Use these assumptions throughout this guide:\"}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"className\":\"list-disc pl-6 mb-4 space-y-2 marker:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"Evidence s"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"hould be verifiable against live operations, not only policy documents.\",\"className\":\"ml-2 mb-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"Open control gaps should sit on decision gates, not in an undefined post-close backlog.\",\"className\":\"ml-2 mb-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":\"The useful output is one scorecard per market with owners, dates, caveats, and a clear decision label.\",\"className\":\"ml-2 mb-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\"}],\"\\n\"]}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"If a market needs extensive verbal explanation to appear ready, treat it as \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded text-sm\",\"node\":{\"type\":\"element\",\"tagName\":\"code\",\"properties\":{},\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"conditional-go\",\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":23,\"column\":77,\"offset\":2317},\"end\":{\"line\":23,\"column\":93,\"offset\":2333}}}],\"position\":{\"start\":{\"line\":23,\"column\":77,\"offset\":2317},\"end\":{\"line\":23,\"column\":93,\"offset\":2333}}},\"children\":\"conditional-go\"}],\" until the evidence catches up.\"]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"For a finance and ops view of diligence, read \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/blog/platform-finance-leaders-mergers-acquisitions-payment-ops-due-diligence\",\"children\":\"How Platform Finance Leaders Decide M\u0026A Payment Ops Readiness\",\"className\":\"text-brand-teal underline decoration-[#0d9488]/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#0d9488] transition-colors\"}],\".\"]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"id\":\"define-acquisition-readiness-in-operator-terms\",\"className\":\"group mt-14 mb-6 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 blog-accent-border font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Define acquisition readiness in operator terms\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#define-acquisition-readiness-in-operator-terms\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Define acquisition readiness in operator terms\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Treat readiness as an internal evidence test, not a slogan. In diligence, use a definition that forces decisions from documented proof, not presentation quality.\"}]\n42:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-1\",{\"id\":\"step-1-set-a-three-pillar-working-definition\",\"className\":\"group mt-8 mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Step 1: Set a three-pillar working definition\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#step-1-set-a-three-pillar-working-definition\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Step 1: Set a three-pillar working definition\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n43:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"Use three pillars as your internal operating lens: \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"Compliance Management System (CMS) maturity\"}],\", technical traceability, and \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"GAAP\"}],\"-ready finance. This is a working framework, not a universal standard.\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"44:[\"$\",\"$Le7\",\"table-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",\"thead-0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-0\",{\"children\":\"Pillar\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-1\",{\"children\":\"Verification question\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-2\",{\"children\":\"Not ready when\",\"className\":\"\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",\"tbody-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"children\":\"Compliance Management System (CMS) maturity\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"children\":\"Can compliance show current policies, monitoring activity, and documented handling of non-compliance findings?\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"children\":\"It depends on verbal explanation instead of records\",\"className\":\"\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"children\":\"Technical traceability\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"children\":\"Can engineering trace a transaction from request through ledger impact and exception handling?\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"children\":\"It depends on verbal explanation instead of records\",\"className\":\"\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"children\":\"GAAP-ready finance\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"children\":\"Can finance tie reported numbers back to support files?\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"children\":\"It depends on verbal explanation instead of records\",\"className\":\"\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"45:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Ground that lens in documented diligence: show that you understand the requirements and have a repeatable process for keeping participants informed on requirements and acquisition approach.\"}]\n46:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"If a pillar depends on verbal explanation instead of records, mark it not ready. Keep evidence current with an owner, version marker, and review date.\"}]\n47:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-2\",{\"id\":\"step-2-define-outputs-before-scoring\",\"className\":\"group mt-8 mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Step 2: Define outputs before scoring\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#step-2-define-outputs-before-scoring\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Step 2: Define outputs before scoring\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n48:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-13\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Define the outputs before you start scoring: an evidence pack, a market decision matrix, and a Day 1 integration risk log. Treat these as internal working artifacts, not source-mandated deliverables.\"}]\n49:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-14\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Each market decision should map to proof, and each open issue should be either a dated remediation item or a blocker. If a control gap could affect monitoring, findings, handoffs, reconciliation, or reporting, log it with an owner and decision date.\"}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-15\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Do not label unresolved controls as \\\"post-close\\\" work without defined impact and dependencies.\"}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-3\",{\"id\":\"step-3-separate-deal-critical-from-nice-to-have\",\"className\":\"group mt-8 mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Step 3: Separate deal-critical from nice-to-have\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#step-3-separate-deal-critical-from-nice-to-have\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Step 3: Separate deal-critical from nice-to-have\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n4c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-16\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Separate what you will need to defend early in diligence and control review from everything else. The first group is deal-critical. The rest is secondary.\"}]\n4d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-17\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"In practice, polished plans are secondary. Current evidence for live controls is deal-critical. Where unresolved issues could drive a less-than-satisfactory evaluation outcome, keep them blocked until remediation is bounded, owned, and verifiable.\"}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-18\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"Related reading: \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/blog/lean-finance-modern-cfo-payment-platform-leader-strategic-driver\",\"children\":\"How Modern CFOs Make Payment Platform Expansion a Strategic Driver\",\"className\":\"text-brand-teal underline decoration-[#0d9488]/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#0d9488] transition-colors\"}],\".\"]}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"id\":\"assemble-prerequisites-before-you-score-markets\",\"className\":\"group mt-14 mb-6 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 blog-accent-border font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Assemble prerequisites before you score markets\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#assemble-prerequisites-before-you-score-markets\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Assemble prerequisites before you score markets\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-10"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-19\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Before you score any market, lock ownership and evidence so decisions are based on records, not live explanations.\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"51:[\"$\",\"$Le7\",\"table-1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",\"thead-0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-0\",{\"children\":\"Scoring gate\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-1\",{\"children\":\"What to verify\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"th-2\",{\"children\":\"If missing\",\"className\":\"\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",\"tbody-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"children\":\"Designated owner\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"children\":\"A designated Authorized Negotiator who is an employee completes the readiness assessment\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"children\":\"Mark the item as unproven\",\"className\":\"\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"children\":\"Recency check\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"children\":\"In eOffer, acknowledge the readiness assessment was completed within the past year\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"children\":\"Mark the item as unproven\",\"className\":\"\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"children\":\"Request terms\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"children\":\"Build the working file set from the MAS solicitation and its attachments\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"children\":\"Do not score the claim as proven\",\"className\":\"\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"tr-3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-0\",{\"children\":\"Financial support\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-1\",{\"children\":\"Include two years of financial statements, or other documentation that demonstrates financial responsibility\",\"className\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"td-2\",{\"children\":\"Mark the item as unproven\",\"className\":\"\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"52:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-4\",{\"id\":\"step-1-assign-a-designated-owner-for-readiness\",\"className\":\"group mt-8 mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Step 1: Assign a designated owner for readiness\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#step-1-assign-a-designated-owner-for-readiness\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Step 1: Assign a designated owner for readiness\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n53:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-20\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"For MAS readiness, a designated \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"Authorized Negotiator\"}],\" who is an employee must complete the readiness assessment. Treat completion as a recency-gated checkpoint; in \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"eOffer\"}],\", acknowledge it was completed within the past year.\"]}]\n54:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-5\",{\"id\":\"step-2-anchor-your-review-to-the-formal-request-terms\",\"className\":\"group mt-8 mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Step 2: Anchor your review to the formal request terms\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#step-2-anchor-your-review-to-the-formal-request-terms\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Step 2: Anchor your review to the formal request terms\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n55:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-21\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"Build your working file set from the \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"MAS solicitation\"}],\" and its attachments, which define required offer elements, evaluation criteria, and terms to comply with. If a claim is not supported by that pack, do not score it as proven.\"]}]\n56:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-6\",{\"id\":\"step-3-make-financial-responsibility-evidence-explicit\",\"className\":\"group mt-8 mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Step 3: Make financial-responsibility evidence explicit\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#step-3-make-financial-responsibility-evidence-explicit\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Step 3: Make financial-responsibility evidence explicit\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n57:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-22\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Include financial-history evidence in the diligence folder. If you do not have two years of financial statements, add other documentation that demonstrates financial responsibility and label that substitution clearly.\"}]\n58:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-7\",{\"id\":\"step-4-score-only-what-is-documented-and-current\",\"className\":\"group mt-8 mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Step 4: Score only what is documented and current\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#step-4-score-only-what-is-documented-and-current\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Step 4: Score only what is documented and current\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n59:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-23\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Apply a simple gate before scoring: owner assigned, readiness checkpoint current, solicitation-aligned evidence present, and financial-responsibility support documented. If one of those is missing, mark the item as unproven instead of forcing a precise score.\"}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-24\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leadin"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"g-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"For a step-by-step walkthrough, see \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/blog/hire-cfo-payment-platform\",\"children\":\"How to Hire a CFO for Your Payment Platform\",\"className\":\"text-brand-teal underline decoration-[#0d9488]/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#0d9488] transition-colors\"}],\".\"]}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"id\":\"build-a-market-by-market-readiness-scorecard\",\"className\":\"group mt-14 mb-6 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 blog-accent-border font-sans\",\"style\":\"$31:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:style\",\"children\":[\"Build a market-by-market readiness scorecard\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#build-a-market-by-market-readiness-scorecard\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Build a market-by-market readiness scorecard\",\"className\":\"ml-2 text-slate-300 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity !no-underline hover:text-brand-teal\",\"children\":\"#\"}]]}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-25\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"Use one scorecard for each market or vertical so readiness decisions come from one evidence set. If a row cannot show current compliance, technical, and financial evidence together, mark it \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"code-0\",{\"className\":\"bg-slate-100 px-1 rounded text-sm\",\"node\":{\"